which
less
man-db
man-pages
nano
vim
tmux
btop
ripgrep
fastfetch
# AppSynergy identity (wordmark motd/banner, icons, greeting) — from [appsynergy] repo
appsynergy-branding
appsynergy-mirrorlist
terminus-font

# hardware probes
